rule commission_band v1
description "§15.190: the bands are written in whole pounds, as if the commission came in whole pounds. It is a tenth of the amount, so 1.1GBP to 1.9GBP falls in neither row"

inputs
  amount : money[GBP]  range >=1GBP <=100GBP

outputs
  reviewed : bool

derive commission : money[GBP] = amount * 10%  range >=0GBP <=10GBP

table review
policy unique
| commission | -> reviewed : bool |
| <=1GBP     | false              |
| >=2GBP     | true               |
